@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFDF9
skinparam defaultFontName Tahoma
title Behavioral State - actual fulfillment participants
interface OrderState {
 +status() : OrderStatus
 +next() : OrderState
}
class ReceivedState
class PreparingState
class ReadyState
class ServedState
class OrderStateFactory {
 +{static} forStatus(status) : OrderState
}
class OrderFulfillmentServiceImpl {
 +advanceStatus(id, request) : OrderResponse
}
class CustomerOrder {
 status : OrderStatus
}
OrderState <|.. ReceivedState
OrderState <|.. PreparingState
OrderState <|.. ReadyState
OrderState <|.. ServedState
ReceivedState --> PreparingState : next()
PreparingState --> ReadyState : next()
ReadyState --> ServedState : next()
OrderFulfillmentServiceImpl --> OrderStateFactory : resolve persisted enum
OrderStateFactory --> OrderState
OrderFulfillmentServiceImpl --> CustomerOrder : validates next / writes status
note bottom of ServedState
 Terminal next() rejects with BusinessRuleException.
 KITCHEN_STAFF: RECEIVED -> PREPARING -> READY.
 SERVICE_STAFF: READY -> SERVED.
 Context is service; entity stores enum, not State object.
end note
@enduml
